.TH PENDING_MAX 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
PENDING_MAX \- Maximum stack changes (push/pop/replace) that may be queued from one callback before they apply
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.ft B
#define PENDING_MAX 8
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Maximum stack changes (push/pop/replace) that may be queued from one callback before they apply. Extra calls are dropped.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
